    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sectoris Sky</strong> is currently in alpha development. The game is playable, but some planned features and content are not yet available. Many updates will be released over time to expand and enrich the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sectoris Sky</strong> takes you on a journey through a fantastical world suspended in the skies. Explore sectors made up of floating islands, filled with mysteries, resources, and formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by allocating your experience points into various stats such as health, stamina, and more, to create your own unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle creatures to gather resources and unlock blueprints, then craft your own equipment. Every crafted item has randomized stats, making each piece of loot and every creation truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Sectoris Sky</strong>, the path to power lies through exploration, combat, and crafting. Become the master of the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sectoris Sky</strong> is constantly evolving. New content, features, and optimizations will be added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
